vatars.githubusercontent.com/u/628593?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/sr55", "html_url": "https://github.com/sr55", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sr55/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sr55/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sr55/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sr55/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sr55/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sr55/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sr55/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sr55/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/sr55/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "content_type": "application/octet-stream", "state": "uploaded", "size": 566, "digest": "sha256:6ac90654f10b1c27dea3d737da857ce6cfbf123bfafec3a1235ca07658a406f7", "download_count": 1472, "created_at": "2026-06-07T19:04:42Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-07T19:04:42Z", "browser_download_url": "https://github.com/HandBrake/HandBrake/releases/download/1.11.2/LibHB-1.11.2-win-x86_64.zip.sig"}], "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/HandBrake/HandBrake/tarball/1.11.2", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/HandBrake/HandBrake/zipball/1.11.2", "body": "## Upgrade Notice\r\n\r\nBefore updating HandBrake, please make sure there are no pending encodes in the queue, and be sure to make a backup of any custom presets and app preferences you have, as they may not be compatible with newer versions.\r\n\r\nWindows users, please make sure to install [Microsoft .NET Desktop Runtime version 10.0](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/en-us/download/dotnet/10.0/runtime)\r\nDownload available from Microsoft:\r\n- [For x64 (AMD or Intel CPUs)](https://aka.ms/dotnet/10.0/windowsdesktop-runtime-win-x64.exe)\r\n- [For Arm64 (Qualcomm or other)](https://aka.ms/dotnet/10.0/windowsdesktop-runtime-win-arm64.exe)\r\n\r\n\r\n## HandBrake 1.11.2\r\n\r\n### All platforms\r\n\r\n#### Video\r\n\r\n- Fixed a crash that happened when doing a 2-pass lossless x265 encode\r\n- Fixed a memory leak that happened when doing a 2-pass MPEG-4/MPEG-2/VP9/FFV1 encode\r\n\r\n#### Audio\r\n\r\n- Updated the list of supported dithers and encoders combinations\r\n- Fixed the Core Audio AAC encoder 7.1 channel layout\r\n\r\n#### Subtitles\r\n\r\n- Fixed the VobSub palette creation in the MP4 container\r\n\r\n#### Build system\r\n\r\n- Improved build system compatibility with older build tools\r\n\r\n#### Third-party libraries\r\n\r\n- Updated libraries\r\n  - FFmpeg 8.0.2 (decoding and filters)\r\n  - SVT-AV1 4.1.0 (AV1 video encoding)\r\n\r\n### Linux\r\n\r\n- Added WebM MIME type to the list of the supported formats\r\n\r\n### Mac\r\n\r\n- Improved handling of unsupported presets\r\n- Updated Sparkle automatic update library\r\n\r\n### Windows\r\n\r\n- Improved handling of unsupported presets\r\n- Improved queue low space pause behaviour\r\n- Fixed the automatic audio track name generation\r\n- Fixed the summary description of HDR video", "discussion_url": "https://github.com/HandBrake/HandBrake/discussions/7912", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/HandBrake/HandBrake/releases/335656806/reactions", "total_count": 75, "+1": 29, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 14, "confused": 0, "heart": 17, "rocket": 11, "eyes": 4}}